        "section_path": "abstract/3",
        "section_heading": "CONCLUSIONS",
        "ordinal": 0,
        "text": "VRET effectively reduces anxiety, phobia, and PTSD symptoms while enhancing approach behaviour in clinically diagnosed patients. Its immersive and adaptable features make it a valuable exposure-based treatment tool. Further RCTs using advanced VR technologies and standardised protocols are needed to strengthen the evidence and optimise clinical application.",
        "text_hash": "e3141af7b50874d99a857e4e75f85e649f9f32b8380f00c19605b89467011a45",
